  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Digestive Assimilation</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/79/Fukuro.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20140309023802\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Fukuro\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/79/Fukuro.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20140309023802\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/79/Fukuro.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20140309023802 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/79/Fukuro.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1031?cb=20140309023802 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Fukuro\" width=\"270\" height=\"220\" data-image-key=\"Fukuro.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Fukuro.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Fukuro (Fairy Tail) can eat other Mages and gain their powers and some characteristics to their prey.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Gain properties of eaten things.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The ability to <b>gain the properties of eaten things.</b> Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDigestive_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Consumptive Absorption</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDigestive_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can consume objects or individuals of choice to gain the properties and attributes of the object or individual by eating, swallowing or trapping an object or prey in your mouth or stomach (or any other body part, similar to a stomach).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDigestive_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilative_Evolution\" title=\"Assimilative Evolution\">Assimilative Evolution</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Absorbing Replication\">Absorbing Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Biological_Absorption\" title=\"Biological Absorption\">Biological Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Consumption_Mimicry\" title=\"Consumption Mimicry\">Consumption Mimicry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Consumptive_Replication\" title=\"Consumptive Replication\">Consumptive Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Infinite_Digestive_System\" title=\"Infinite Digestive System\">Infinite Digestive System</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Matter_Ingestion\" title=\"Matter Ingestion\">Matter Ingestion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mimicry_Form\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mimicry Form\">Mimicry Form</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Symbiotic_Absorption\" title=\"Symbiotic Absorption\">Symbiotic Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDigestive_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Amount of time the user can keep an object/individual in their body may be temporary and will certainly wear off over a period of time.</li>\n<li>User's usage of the abilities of the consumed object/individual may be considered inferior to the actual object/individual's usage.</li>\n<li>Object or individual consumed by the user may steadily damage and even kill the user over time.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDigestive_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>See also: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/CannibalismSuperpower\">Cannibalism Superpower</a></i>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"scrollable\" style=\"overflow:auto; max-height:275px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0.5em; background:transparent;\">\n<ul><li>Hajime Nagumo (<i>Arifureta: From Commonplace to World's Strongest</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bleach.fandom.com/wiki/Aaroniero_Arruruerie\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bleach:Aaroniero Arruruerie\">Aaroniero Arruruerie</a> (<i>Bleach</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bleach.fandom.com/wiki/Liltotto_Lamperd\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bleach:Liltotto Lamperd\">Liltotto Lamperd</a> (<i>Bleach</i>); via <b>G - The Glutton</b></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bleach.fandom.com/wiki/Pernida_Parnkgjas\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bleach:Pernida Parnkgjas\">Pernida Parnkgjas</a> (<i>Bleach</i>)</li>\n<li>Bolt Crank (<i>Eat-Man</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://fairytail.fandom.com/wiki/Fukuro\">Fukuro</a> (<i>Fairy Tail</i>)</li>\n<li>Qu race (<i>Final Fantasy 9</i>)\n<ul><li>Quina Quen</li></ul></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://fma.fandom.com/wiki/Pride\">Pride</a> (<i>Full Metal Alchemist</i>)</li>\n<li>The strange orchid (<i>Green Thoughts</i>)</li>\n<li>Kronis/Trap Jaw (<i>He-Man and the Masters of the Universe</i>)</li>\n<li>\"Pet Shop\" (<i>I Get Stronger by Eating</i>)</li>\n<li>Kaibara (<i>Isekai Shikkaku</i>)</li>\n<li>Olivia \"Liv\" Moore (<i>iZombie</i>); via brain eating</li>\n<li>Yuji Itadori (<i>Jujutsu Kaisen</i>)</li>\n<li>Kirby (<i>Kirby</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://lou.fandom.com/wiki/Hanon\">Hanon</a> (<i>The Law of Ueki</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.mariowiki.com/Yoshi\">Yoshi</a> (<i>Mario</i>)</li>\n<li>Atum/Demogorge (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/c:myheroacademiaTamaki_Amajiki\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:myheroacademiaTamaki Amajiki\">Tamaki Amajiki</a> (<i>My Hero Academia</i>)</li>\n<li>Ultimate Summoning Beast (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://onepiece.fandom.com/wiki/Wapol\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:onepiece:Wapol\">Wapol</a> (<i>One Piece</i>); via the <a href=\"https://onepiece.fandom.com/wiki/Baku_Baku_no_Mi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:onepiece:Baku Baku no Mi\">Baku Baku no Mi</a></li>\n<li>Tomokui Kanata/Rou (<i>Re:Monster</i>)</li>\n<li>Zeruel&#160;the 10th Angel (<i>Rebuild of Evangelion 2.22 - You Can (Not) Advance</i>)</li>\n<li>Atma Users (<i>Shin Megami Tensei: Digital Devil Saga</i>)</li>\n<li>Chaos (<i>Sonic Adventure</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://supernatural.fandom.com/wiki/Leo\">Chef Leo</a> (<i>Supernatural</i>); via a magic spell</li>\n<li>Kavaxas (<i>Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles</i> (2012))</li>\n<li>Orc Disaster <a href=\"https://tensura.fandom.com/wiki/Geld_I\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:tensura:Geld I\">Geld</a> (<i>That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime</i>); via \"<a href=\"https://tensura.fandom.com/wiki/Starved\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:tensura:Starved\">Starved</a>\"</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tensura.fandom.com/wiki/Rimuru_Tempest\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:tensura:Rimuru Tempest\">Rimuru Tempest</a> (<i>That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime</i>); via \"<a href=\"https://tensura.fandom.com/wiki/Predator\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:tensura:Predator\">Predator</a>\"</li>\n<li>Users of Food Immersion (<i>Toriko</i>)</li>\n<li>Cy-Bugs (<i>Wreck-it Ralph</i>)\n<ul><li>King Candy/Turbo (<i>Wreck-it Ralph</i>); after becoming a Cy-Bug</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://warhammer40k.fandom.com/wiki/Kroot\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:warhammer40k:Kroot\">Kroot</a> (<i>Warhammer 40,000</i>)</li>\n<li>Elder Toguro (<i>Yu Yu Hakusho</i>); after possessing Gourmet's body</li>\n<li>Sadao Makihara/Gourmet (<i>Yu Yu Hakusho</i>)</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDigestive_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"97674de4c0d4a4ba12da006c809acff0\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:197px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:197px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Aaroniero_Arruruerie_Resurreccion-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:146px; width:195px; top:24.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Aaroniero_Arruruerie_Resurreccion.jpg\" title=\"Aaroniero Arruruerie Resurreccion.jpg (27 KB)\" style=\"height:146px; width:195px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/7c/Aaroniero_Arruruerie_Resurreccion.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/195?cb=20121110074400\" title=\"Aaroniero Arruruerie Resurreccion.jpg (27 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Aaroniero Arruruerie (Bleach) has access to the memories and powers of every hollow he has devoured, to the point of mimicking Kaien Shiba in front of Rukia.\" height=\"195\" width=\"195\" data-image-name=\"Aaroniero Arruruerie Resurreccion.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Aaroniero_Arruruerie_Resurreccion.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Aaroniero Arruruerie (Bleach) has access to the memories and powers of every hollow he has devoured, to the point of mimicking Kaien Shiba in front of Rukia.\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Aaroniero Arruruerie Resurreccion.jpg (27 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Aaroniero Arruruerie (Bleach) has access to the memories and powers of every hollow he has devoured, to the point of mimicking Kaien Shiba in front of Rukia.\" height=\"195\" width=\"195\" data-image-na